*-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Molecule: H6 chain, R = 1.0 Angstrom
* Basis: ANO-RCC-MB
* Symmetry: C1
* Features tested: keyword FARO without Lucia (Faroald in its own CSF basis,
*                  the configuration order of citrans): SA-CASSCF(6,6) with 3
*                  singlet roots and XMSI, XMS-CASPT2 and RASSI on the JOBIPH;
*                  CIONLY triplet (2 roots), doublet and quintet
* Responsible person: Roland Lindh
* Comments: As csf_sd:020 with MOLCAS_CI_VERIFY=NO: Faroald runs without
